{
  "name": "HTGF engine: hourly sourcing run",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "hours",
              "hoursInterval": 1
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "d46b30d1-8a96-4b37-8b1a-16e5703a5db4",
      "name": "Every hour",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "http://localhost:8787/api/run",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "{\n  \"sources\": [\"github\", \"ct\", \"incubator\"]\n}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 30000
        }
      },
      "id": "12eb19b2-768e-4578-b0b6-98d0d841939c",
      "name": "Start sourcing run",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup\nBase URL is **http://localhost:8787** (the engine: `cd engine && npm start`).\n\n- n8n in **Docker**: replace localhost with **host.docker.internal**\n- **n8n cloud**: expose the engine with a tunnel (e.g. `cloudflared tunnel --url http://localhost:8787` or `ngrok http 8787`) and use that URL\n\nSearch & replace the URL in every HTTP Request node, then activate the workflow.\n\n**What it does:** POST /api/run every hour. Returns 202 immediately (the run is async). A 409 means the previous run is still going; that is fine, *On Error* is set to continue.",
        "height": 320,
        "width": 460
      },
      "id": "3c9bd26c-bf9b-4ae4-9255-a1459f0def6b",
      "name": "Setup note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -360
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every hour": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Start sourcing run",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": true
  },
  "tags": []
}